## 6. Case Lifecycle Actions

| Action | API | When valid |
| ------ | --- | ---------- |
| Start / schedule case | `POST /theatre-flows/start` | Linked admission/encounter; procedure and team assigned |
| Update stage | `POST /theatre-flows/:id/update-stage` | Valid stage transition per backend sequence |
| Toggle checklist item | Theatre-flow checklist routes | Phase matches current stage |
| Upsert anesthesia record | Theatre-flow anesthesia routes | During pre-op through PACU |
| Upsert post-op note | Theatre-flow post-op routes | Post-op / handoff stages |
| Assign / release resources | Resource assign/release routes | Room, team slots available |
| Finalize / reopen | Per policy and role | Case completion or authorized reopen |

**Rules:**

- Stage transitions must follow backend sequence; reject invalid jumps with user-friendly messages.
- Closing a case does **not** close the IPD encounter.
- Post-op orders (medication, lab) route to IPD encounter via clinical actions ([ipd-flow §7](./ipd-flow.mdc)).

